cv-start = 📄 Send your CV as a PDF, DOCX, image, or pasted text for a full review. Use /help to see the other tools.
ai-unavailable = AI tools are unavailable right now. Please try again later.
cv-help =
    📄 Send a CV to see your score, ATS readiness and practical fixes.
    /match — compare your CV with a job description
    /coverletter — write a cover letter
    /linkedin — headline and About summary
    /export — improved CV PDF (VIP; classic or modern)
    /interview — five questions with answer feedback
    /share — share your score card
    /pro — buy one detailed Pro review with Stars
    /forget — delete your reports and active CV session
    /cancel — leave the current action
cv-privacy =
    🔒 Files are processed in memory or temporary files and deleted. Your CV text stays only in process memory for up to 15 minutes so follow-up tools can work. Only analysis summaries are saved, without original CV text or rewritten excerpts. The configured AI provider receives your CV for processing. Use /forget to delete your summaries and active session. Payment records are retained separately.
cv-cancelled = ✅ Current action cancelled.
cv-forgotten = 🗑 Your report summaries and active CV session have been deleted.
cv-session-expired = 📄 Send your CV again to use this tool. Source sessions expire after 15 minutes and after a restart.
cv-no-report = Send a CV first to get a score card.
cv-ai-error = The review could not be completed. Please try again; an unsuccessful analysis does not use your daily allowance or Pro credit.
cv-busy = Your CV is being processed. Please wait for the result.
cv-quota = You have used your { $max } free full analysis today. Get VIP for unlimited analyses or buy one Pro review.
cv-file-limit = This file exceeds the allowed download size. Please send a smaller file.
