cv-too-short = Please send a complete CV with at least 40 characters.
cv-extract-error = I could not read this CV. Send a readable PDF, DOCX, JPG, PNG, WEBP, or UTF-8 text file within the page limit. Password-protected PDFs must be unlocked first.
